5.2 Foreach Version:


Code
set.seed(1234)

system.time({
  foreach_result &lt;- foreach(i = 1:3, .combine = c) %do% {
    max(rnorm(5))
  }
})


   user  system elapsed 
      0       0       0

5.4 parLapply Version:


Code
cl &lt;- makeCluster(detectCores() - 1)

set.seed(1234)

system.time({
  par_result &lt;- unlist(parLapply(cl, 1:3, function(i) {
    max(rnorm(5))
  }))
})


   user  system elapsed 
   0.02    0.00    0.00 


Code
stopCluster(cl)
